#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""p14 tests: the p13 suite (classical P.3/P.4 code frozen; its certificates P13_* are regenerated by byte-identical code
and gated by the p14 release, code/p5_entry/release_p14.py) plus the P.5 ENTRY tests: quantum object, prescription
and D11 matching, counterterm domain, amplitude rules and their mutations, D12 Missing (never zero), projected vs bulk,
the five-flag P.5 entry gate, the hard stops, and the P.3/P.4 freeze bound to the p13 tree.

End-to-end chain (each in an isolated copy of code/certificates/exports/ledgers/archival):
  mutation -> stage residual or failed prerequisite -> flag false -> classical readiness false (and the frozen
           values change) -> release_claim_accepted false -> publication rejected (exit != 0, no P14_closure_release.json).
"""
